(A list element may itself be a list, and "is a list" tells the two apart)

A list called tree is [1, [2, 3], "four", [5, [6, 7]]].
Print tree.

A list called branch is element 2 of tree.
Print branch.
Print branch's length.
For each number in branch, print number.

For each item in tree,
    if item is a list then,
        print "list".
    Otherwise,
        print "scalar".
